{"candidateAnswer":"A couple of outdoor activities involving nature and exercise","evidence":"[D3:27 | 4:21 pm on 16 July, 2023] John: I started surfing five years ago and it's been great. I love the connection to nature.\n[D12:6 | 3:00 pm on 2 October, 2023] John: Yeah! Such a great day! It was so beautiful having everyone celebrating with us. I'd never felt so much love and happiness before. Some of my hiking club friends came even though I just joined!","itemId":"urn:uuid:c97f5fb6-4338-5ea8-99ac-d646ee4745bd","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:e6dd29b21d36fc5eb4b500d456b567d8c210623bd312c085a421b636094f4cea","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What outdoor activities does John enjoy?","referenceAnswer":"Hiking, surfing","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"e6dd29b21d36fc5eb4b500d456b567d8c210623bd312c085a421b636094f4cea"}}]}